@@ -15,3 +15,21 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Phone verification (sign-up)
+
+Sign-up requires verifying a mobile number with a 6-digit SMS one-time passcode
+(`/api/phone/send-code` → `/api/phone/verify-code` → `/api/register`). SMS messages
+use the [WebOTP](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/identity/web-apis/web-otp) format so
+supporting browsers can fill in the code automatically; the input also uses
+`autocomplete="one-time-code"` for iOS/Android keyboard suggestions.
+
+| Variable | Purpose |
+| --- | --- |
+| `TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID`, `TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN` | Twilio credentials used to send SMS |
+| `TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER` or `TWILIO_MESSAGING_SERVICE_SID` | Sender for the SMS |
+| `OTP_SECRET` | HMAC key for hashing codes (random per process if unset) |
+| `SMS_OTP_DOMAIN` | Host used in the WebOTP `@host #code` line (defaults to the request host) |
+| `SMS_DELIVERY=console` | Log codes to the server console instead of sending SMS (always on in `astro dev`) |
+
+Without a configured provider in production, the send-code endpoint returns `503`.
